{"id":"benchmark-livecodebench-function-tests-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Implement a JavaScript function `uniqueSorted(values)` that returns unique finite numbers in ascending order. Include three focused tests and no dependencies."}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"```js\nexport function uniqueSorted(values) {\n  return [...new Set(values.filter(Number.isFinite))].sort((a, b) => a - b);\n}\n\nconsole.assert(JSON.stringify(uniqueSorted([3, 1, 3, 2])) === '[1,2,3]');\nconsole.assert(JSON.stringify(uniqueSorted([NaN, 2, Infinity, -1])) === '[-1,2]');\nconsole.assert(JSON.stringify(uniqueSorted([])) === '[]');\n```"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"min_chars":220,"must_include":["Number.isFinite","new Set","sort((a, b) => a - b)","console.assert"],"must_not_include":["TODO"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"code_generation_with_tests","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"functional_code_generation","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","benchmark_family":"livecodebench","benchmark_task":"code-generation","benchmark_reference_id":"livecodebench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"final_answer","tags":["livecodebench","javascript","tests"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-livecodebench-self-repair-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"修复代码：`function last(xs){ return xs[xs.length]; }`。说明根因，并给出空数组行为明确的实现和测试。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"根因是数组最后一个索引为 `length - 1`，原实现访问了越界位置。\n```js\nfunction last(xs) {\n  if (!Array.isArray(xs) || xs.length === 0) return undefined;\n  return xs[xs.length - 1];\n}\nconsole.assert(last([1, 2, 3]) === 3);\nconsole.assert(last([]) === undefined);\n```"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":175,"must_include":["length - 1","越界","undefined","console.assert"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"code_self_repair","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"code_debugging","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"foundational","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","benchmark_family":"livecodebench","benchmark_task":"self-repair","benchmark_reference_id":"livecodebench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"final_answer","tags":["livecodebench","debug","off-by-one"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-livecodebench-output-prediction-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Debug this JavaScript by first predicting the exact output, then explain why: `const xs=[1,2,3]; console.log(xs.map(x=>x*2).filter(x=>x>3).join(','));`"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"Exact output: `4,6`\n\n`map` produces `[2,4,6]`, `filter(x => x > 3)` keeps `[4,6]`, and `join(',')` converts that array to the string `4,6`."}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"answer_pattern":"^Exact output: `4,6`","must_include":["[2,4,6]","[4,6]","join(',')"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"code_output_prediction","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"code_execution_reasoning","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"foundational","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"diagnostic","benchmark_family":"livecodebench","benchmark_task":"test-output-prediction","benchmark_reference_id":"livecodebench","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"final_answer","tags":["livecodebench","execution","prediction"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-swelancer-feature-acceptance-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"实现接口变更：`POST /jobs` 必须支持 `Idempotency-Key`；相同用户和 key 的重复请求返回首次 job，不得重复入队。给出最小设计、事务边界和测试清单。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"最小设计：建立 `(user_id, idempotency_key)` 唯一索引，并保存首次响应关联的 `job_id`。在同一数据库事务中先插入幂等记录和 Job，再提交 Outbox；唯一键冲突时读取并返回原 `job_id`，不再次写 Outbox。测试至少覆盖首次创建、串行重复、并发重复、不同用户同 key、事务回滚后重试，以及队列投递失败后的 Outbox 重放。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":135,"must_include":["唯一索引","同一数据库事务","Outbox","并发重复","不同用户同 key"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"real_world_feature_design","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"production_feature_design","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","benchmark_family":"swe-lancer","benchmark_task":"independent-engineering-task","benchmark_reference_id":"swe-lancer","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"agent_tools","tags":["swe-lancer","idempotency","acceptance-tests"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-swelancer-managerial-choice-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"比较两个修复方案并做决策：A 在前端重试所有失败请求；B 在服务端增加幂等键、限定可重试错误并使用退避。问题是支付创建偶发超时且出现重复订单。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"analyst"}},{"agent":"analyst","action":"answer","content":"选择 B。重复订单的根因要求服务端用幂等键保证同一业务操作只创建一次；重试应只覆盖超时和可恢复错误，并使用带抖动的退避。A 会把不可恢复错误和非幂等请求一起重放，反而放大重复与流量。实施前还应定义幂等记录 TTL、并发冲突行为和可观测指标。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"analysis","task_type":"analysis_decision_support","risk":"low","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"analyst"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":105,"must_include":["选择 B","幂等键","可恢复错误","退避","TTL"],"must_not_include":["选择 A"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"engineering_managerial_decision","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"engineering_tradeoff_decision","domain":"software_engineering","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"regression","benchmark_family":"swe-lancer","benchmark_task":"managerial-proposal-selection","benchmark_reference_id":"swe-lancer","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"agent_routing","tags":["swe-lancer","managerial","tradeoff"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-spider2-sql-dialect-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"写代码：为 Snowflake 生成 SQL。表 orders(order_id, customer_id, created_at, amount)，按 2026 年 8 月每位客户总金额降序取前 10 名；金额并列时 customer_id 升序。只返回 SQL。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"SELECT customer_id, SUM(amount) AS total_amount\nFROM orders\nWHERE created_at >= '2026-08-01' AND created_at < '2026-09-01'\nGROUP BY customer_id\nORDER BY total_amount DESC, customer_id ASC\nLIMIT 10;"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"min_chars":150,"must_include":["SUM(amount)","created_at >= '2026-08-01'","created_at < '2026-09-01'","GROUP BY customer_id","ORDER BY total_amount DESC, customer_id ASC","LIMIT 10"],"must_not_include":["```"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"enterprise_text_to_sql","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"sql_generation","domain":"data_engineering","difficulty":"intermediate","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"model_selection","benchmark_family":"spider-2","benchmark_task":"dialect-aware-text-to-sql","benchmark_reference_id":"spider-2","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"final_answer","tags":["spider-2","snowflake","sql"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-spider2-ambiguity-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"写代码查询“本季度最有价值客户”。数据库里有 revenue、gross_margin、lifetime_value 三个指标，但业务没有定义“最有价值”。先不要生成 SQL。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"在生成 SQL 前需要确认一个定义：这里的“最有价值”应按本季度 revenue、本季度 gross_margin，还是累计 lifetime_value 排序？还需要确认并列处理方式。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"language":"zh","min_chars":55,"must_include":["需要确认","revenue","gross_margin","lifetime_value","并列"],"must_not_include":["SELECT "]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"text_to_sql_clarification","risk":"medium","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"schema_semantic_clarification","domain":"data_engineering","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","benchmark_family":"spider-2","benchmark_task":"ambiguous-enterprise-workflow","benchmark_reference_id":"spider-2","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"intent_routing","tags":["spider-2","ambiguity","clarification"]}}
{"id":"benchmark-spider2-sensitive-column-001","suite":"benchmark-software-data","input":{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"写代码生成 SQL：从 customers(customer_id,email,phone,segment) 导出 enterprise 客户名单给外部供应商。供应商只需要 customer_id 用于对账。"}],"script":[{"agent":"copilot","action":"tool","tool":"transfer_to_agent","arguments":{"agent_name":"software_development_assistant"}},{"agent":"software_development_assistant","action":"answer","content":"SELECT customer_id\nFROM customers\nWHERE segment = 'enterprise';\n\n只选择对账所需的 customer_id，不应把 email 或 phone 暴露给外部供应商；导出前仍应确认授权、传输和保留策略。"}]},"expected":{"intent":{"domain":"software_engineering","task_type":"software_engineering","risk":"medium","requires_fresh_data":false},"route":{"mode":"delegate","agentId":"software_development_assistant"},"tools":{"required":["transfer_to_agent"],"forbidden":["TavilySearchTool"]},"response":{"min_chars":110,"must_include":["SELECT customer_id","segment = 'enterprise'","不应把 email 或 phone 暴露","授权"],"must_not_include":["SELECT *","SELECT customer_id, email","SELECT customer_id,email"]},"trace":{"required_kinds":["CHAIN","AGENT RUN","SPAN","GENERATION","TOOL CALL"]}},"metadata":{"dataset_version":"copilot-benchmark-software-data.v1","task_type":"privacy_preserving_text_to_sql","risk":"high","source":"benchmark-inspired-original","label_status":"specification-derived","evaluation_dimension":"vertical_capability","capability":"data_minimization","domain":"data_engineering","difficulty":"advanced","interaction_pattern":"single_turn","decision_use":"release_gate","benchmark_family":"spider-2","benchmark_task":"enterprise-data-boundary","benchmark_reference_id":"spider-2","benchmark_adaptation":"methodology-inspired-original","live_eligible":true,"workflow_stage":"final_answer","tags":["spider-2","privacy","data-minimization"]}}
